\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces The H\'enon specialization as an exact static certificate. The top panels track the one-form identity, determinant, $G/L$ sign, and low-period neighbor multiplicity. The lower panels distinguish the all-period no-infinity proof ledger from the valuation refinement. The fixed point with action $-1/3$ makes the denominator-three boundary sharp. No periodic equation was solved to construct the figure.}}{9}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:henon-static}{{3}{9}{The H\'enon specialization as an exact static certificate. The top panels track the one-form identity, determinant, $G/L$ sign, and low-period neighbor multiplicity. The lower panels distinguish the all-period no-infinity proof ledger from the valuation refinement. The fixed point with action $-1/3$ makes the denominator-three boundary sharp. No periodic equation was solved to construct the figure}{figure.3}{}}
